{"ref":"BDB, חִתִּית","hw":"חִתִּית","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּית</span></big>  <strong>n.f. terror</strong>, only Ezek.; abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.23\">Ez 32:23</a>, but Co reads <span dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּיתָם</span> (with 𝔊 and v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.26\">26</a>); cstr. <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.27\">32:27</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חתיתו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:32\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.32\">32:32</a> Kt (> <span dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּיתִי</span> Qr); <span dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּיתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.24\">32:24</a> + 2 times + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.17\">26:17</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּיתָהּ</span>, with 𝔊 Ew Co, see VB, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.30\">32:30</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">חַתִּים</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חַת³\" href=\"/BDB,_חַת³\", dir=\"rtl\">ii. חת</a>);—<em>terror</em>, caused by powerful cities, nations, kings, etc.: usually c. sf. as obj. genit. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.17\">Ez 26:17</a> (of Tyre); elsewhere only <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32\">Ez 32</a>: v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.27\">27</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ גִּבּוֹרִים</span>, 𝔖 Co <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ גבור תם</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:30\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.30\">30</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּיתָם</span>, but read <span dir=\"rtl\">חַתִּים</span>, v. supr.); especially in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַן ח׳ בארץ חַיִּים</span> <em>cause one’s terror</em> (terror of oneself) <em>in the land of the living</em> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.23\">23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.24\">24</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:25\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.25\">25</a> (del. 𝔊 Co), v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:32\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.32\">32</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּית</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.3\">Ez 16:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:45\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.45\">45</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חִתִּית\" href=\"/BDB,_חִתִּית\", dir=\"rtl\">חִתִּי</a> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֵת²\" href=\"/BDB,_חֵת²\", dir=\"rtl\">חֵת</a> supr. p. 366.","next":"BDB, מְחִתָּה","prev":"BDB, חַתְחַת"}